    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2P7ScB88xf3JitYnDkQ28Vq)_\n\n**Before:** the Posframe set in `CHANGELOG.org` had 20 long lines (#119 to #174), most of them describing attempts that failed.\n\n**After:**\n- The set is a short summary (three lines) plus a link to the doc.\n- `docs/tangles/ui/sp-posframe.org` has a new section \"Problems with getting the centred posframe right\" with two tables: *What did not work* (PR, attempt, outcome and why it failed: #114 to #161) and *What worked, and what is still waiting* (#136, #137, #142, #156, #157, #163, #174).\n- The existing per-commit table and rebuild plan are unchanged.\n\nDocs only. Based on `main` after #177 merged, so no conflict with it. The outcomes are taken from the PR descriptions and the existing history section; #174 is still open and unconfirmed, and #174 keeps its line under *Open pull requests*.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBMCZyWCqhUX97rKn8)_",
